  "reasoning": "The claim misrepresents the widely cited March 2023 Goldman Sachs economic report. The authors estimated that generative AI could expose the equivalent of roughly 300 million full-time jobs globally to automation, not that 300 million jobs would be outright eliminated or replaced. The report emphasized that for the majority of workers, generative AI will complement rather than substitute labor, automating specific tasks while potentially boosting overall productivity and creating new roles.",
